<title>POLAND: ECHO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 79.</title>
<headline>ECHO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 79.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 34,900 shares of Polish publisher Echo Press at 79 zlotys a share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Echo rose 1.3 percent to 79 zlotys in a volume of 3,893 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
